  "body": "When deciding whether a stylesheet is script-blocking, the [current spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#contributes-a-script-blocking-style-sheet) says:\r\n\r\n> If the `el` is a `link` element, it's `media` attribute's value matches the environment.\r\n\r\nIs there any reason why we don't consider a `style` element's `media` attribute?",
